sqlparse-rs
===========

This project is a behavioral Rust port of the hot paths (lexer, statement
splitter) of python-sqlparse 0.6.0:

  https://github.com/andialbrecht/sqlparse  (BSD 3-Clause)

The port was derived from the upstream source to be output-compatible:
byte-identical token streams and statement splits are asserted by the
differential test suite against the reference Python implementation.
Keyword tables are generated from the reference implementation's data.
This distribution is not endorsed by, or affiliated with, the
python-sqlparse project.
